A pagination bar builds its page buttons with this helper. What does `pageRange(4, 10)` return?

```js
function pageRange(current, total) {
  const pages = new Set([1, total, current - 1, current, current + 1]);
  const sorted = [...pages]
    .filter(p => p >= 1 && p <= total)
    .sort((a, b) => a - b);
  const out = [];
  sorted.forEach((p, i) => {
    if (i > 0 && p - sorted[i - 1] > 1) out.push('…');
    out.push(p);
  });
  return out;
}
```

